@startuml CryptoWeb-state-08-alert
title CryptoWeb - Personal Alert Lifecycle

!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 65
skinparam ranksep 65
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam StateFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
hide empty description

state "OPEN" as Open
state "ACK" as Ack
state "CLOSED" as Closed

[*] --> Open : qualifying signal generates alert
Open --> Ack : user acknowledges
Open --> Closed : user closes
Ack --> Closed : user closes
Ack --> Open : user reopens
Closed --> Open : user reopens
Closed --> Ack : user sets acknowledgement

note right of Open
  Alerts are deduplicated by user,
  signal key and time bucket. New
  signals can update scores without
  resetting ACK or CLOSED status.
end note

note right of Closed
  The status API accepts OPEN,
  ACK and CLOSED directly. There
  is no stricter transition guard.
end note

@enduml
